      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dear Team, our commitment to a cohesive culture and mutual respect is foundational to our success, and we now require from all employees that political expression in the workplace remain strictly private to avoid division. This policy ensures that every one of you feels equally included while allowing you to maintain your right to personal views outside of our shared professional environment. Please ensure you uphold this standard in all group communications and interactions going forward. We value your diverse perspectives and trust you to contribute to a respectful and unified work atmosphere.",
